  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Front Line Defenders (FLD) is a leading Irish human rights INGO working globally to deliver critical support to human rights defenders who are at risk as a result of their human rights work, including in challenging contexts. FLD make a significant contribution to strengthening the security and resilience of human rights defenders around the world, and its advocacy has had important successes in placing the issue of human rights at the centre of international dialogue.</narrative>
